                            <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
                            <p>
                                By accessing or using AuctionChamp, you confirm that you have read, understood,
                                and agree to be bound by these Terms and applicable laws.
                            </p>

                            <h2>2. Use of Services</h2>
                            <ul>
                                <li>You agree to use the platform only for lawful and authorized tournament operations.</li>
                                <li>You are responsible for account credentials and all activities under your account.</li>
                                <li>You must not misuse, reverse engineer, or attempt unauthorized access to the platform.</li>
                            </ul>

                            <h2>3. Subscription and Access</h2>
                            <p>
                                Feature availability depends on the subscribed plan. We may update features,
                                limits, and plan structure with notice where applicable.
                            </p>

                            <h2>4. Data and Content Responsibility</h2>
                            <p>
                                Tournament organizers are responsible for the accuracy, legality, and ownership
                                of data uploaded to AuctionChamp, including player images and personal details.
                            </p>

                            <h2>5. Intellectual Property</h2>
