                            </p>

                            <h2>6. Service Availability</h2>
                            <p>
                                We aim for high availability but do not guarantee uninterrupted or error-free service.
                                Planned maintenance or technical issues may temporarily affect access.
                            </p>

                            <h2>7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
                            <p>
                                To the maximum extent permitted by law, AuctionChamp is not liable for indirect,
                                incidental, or consequential damages arising from use of the platform.
                            </p>

                            <h2>8. Termination</h2>
                            <p>
                                We may suspend or terminate access for violations of these Terms, non-payment,
                                or activities that threaten platform security or integrity.
                            </p>

                            <h2>9. Governing Law</h2>
                            <p>
                                These Terms are governed by applicable laws in India, subject to jurisdiction
                                of competent courts.
                            </p>

                            <h2>10. Contact</h2>
                            <p>
                                For legal or contractual queries, contact
                                <a href="mailto:auctionchamp.live@gmail.com">auctionchamp.live@gmail.com</a>.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <footer class="ac-footer" style="padding-top:36px;">
                    <div class="ac-footer-bottom" style="border-top:none; padding-top:0;">
                        <span class="ac-footer-tagline">"Powering the Future of Cricket Auctions &amp; Tournament Management"</span>
                        <span class="ac-footer-copyright">&#169; <t t-esc="current_year"/> AuctionChamp. All rights reserved.</span>
                    </div>
                </footer>
                <script src="/auction_champ_website/static/src/js/auction_website.js"></script>
            </body>
        </html>
    </template>
</odoo>
